================================================================================
DISCLAIMER
================================================================================

This software is provided for general use. The accuracy of transcriptions
depends on various factors including audio quality, speaker clarity, background
noise, and the chosen model size.

The speaker diarization feature uses a simplified algorithm and may not always
accurately identify speakers, especially when:
- Multiple speakers sound similar
- Audio quality is poor
- Multiple people speak simultaneously

For mission-critical applications, please verify transcriptions and consider
using professional-grade speaker diarization solutions.

================================================================================
PRIVACY NOTICE
================================================================================

This software is designed to operate entirely offline and does not transmit
any data to external servers (except for the initial download of AI models
during installation).

All processing occurs locally on your machine. However, users are responsible
for:
- Ensuring compliance with local laws regarding recording conversations
- Obtaining necessary consents when recording others
- Securing exported transcripts and snapshots appropriately
- Understanding that snapshots and transcripts are saved locally

